uilder} but the specialized {@link org.apache.camel.builder.AdviceWithRouteBuilder} * has additional features when using the <a href="http://camel.apache.org/advicewith.html">advice with</a> feature. * We therefore suggest you to use the {@link org.apache.camel.builder.AdviceWithRouteBuilder}.
